+## Level 5 M8 reducer audit (2026-10-12)
+
+`level-five-simulation.ts` uses the actual reducer, unchanged catalogs and the
+cap-5 QA context. It starts a synthetic funded clinic at zero XP, constructs
+all five prestige rooms, retains normal Level 1-4 rooms/staff, and pays a default
+$45 Executive. It reconciles each command with unique receipts, settlements,
+stock, actual operating postings and separately charged capital. Retired totals,
+reloads, daily rounds, actual garden/gym use, bounded metrics, movement progress
+and the full inspection report are checked independently.
+
+The complete invocation is:
+
+```powershell
+$env:NODE_OPTIONS='--import=file:///C:/Users/rowla/Projects/GamifySurgery/.local-dev/alerts-events-validation/ignore-net-use-eperm.mjs'
+node --disable-warning=ExperimentalWarning tools/economy-audit/level-five-run.mjs --write
+```
+
+This runs 12 economic scenarios on three paired seeds (4 warmup + 48 measured
+hours each), three 80%-accuracy runs through the actual goals and first full
+inspection, and one 90%-accuracy comparison. Every pacing run continues for
+another operating day after Keep playing. Runtime clinical data and rules are
+unchanged; the response script selects existing correct/incorrect keys and
+performs one chart action per game minute. Passive references suppress scored
+arrivals explicitly. Half-gift is an exogenous opportunity-withholding scenario;
+slow-demand additionally uses the ordinary appointments toggle for alternate
+half-days. These demand sensitivities are separate from normal-default evidence.
+
+The same computation can be split into independent native Node processes:
+
+```powershell
+node --disable-warning=ExperimentalWarning tools/economy-audit/level-five-run.mjs --seed=level-five-m8.01 --write --resume
+node --disable-warning=ExperimentalWarning tools/economy-audit/level-five-run.mjs --seed=level-five-m8.02 --write --resume
+node --disable-warning=ExperimentalWarning tools/economy-audit/level-five-run.mjs --seed=level-five-m8.03 --write --resume
+node --disable-warning=ExperimentalWarning tools/economy-audit/level-five-run.mjs --merge --write
+```
+
+Partial results/cache live only in `.local-dev/level5-m8/audit-parts/`. Resume
+requires an identical source fingerprint, with one explicitly pinned historical
+exception in `level-five-audit-provenance-20261012.json`: completed non-training
+runs retain their actual earlier audit source key after the isolated training
+scheduler correction. Every gameplay/data input and all executed non-training
+code must remain unchanged. Earlier production revisions and old training
+caches are rejected. Merge rejects changed/missing inputs and incomplete
+coverage. `--pacing-only` / `--economy-only` can populate one part's
+cache, followed by its full seed command. `--smoke` runs three economic controls
+read-only. No flag overwrites the Level 4 or October 8 artifacts.
+
+Only the complete `--write` or verified merge publishes
+`level-five-results-20261012.json` and the actual paused 2999/3000 inspection save
+in `tests/fixtures/level-five-economy-checkpoint-20261012.json`. QA on the existing
+5184 server uses `?level5=economy` (funded zero-XP opening) or
+`?level5=economy-inspection` (actual audit checkpoint), with either
+`&layout=desktop` or `&layout=phone`. It runs no browser answer bot, resumes
+existing campaigns, preserves owner storage, and leaves the ordinary cap at 4.
+
+Economic receipt/cost fields cover the 48 measured hours. Effect witnesses and
+minimum cash cover the entire 52-hour run, including warmup. The isolated
+reader-training sensitivity withholds unanswered staff discussions and requests
+as soon as the production quote permits it after normal arrival. It verifies
+60 actual seated minutes and return, and measures genuinely earned tier 2
+afterward. Normal references and pacing retain ordinary staff discussions.
+`executiveComfortUses` counts applied
+frozen comfort quotes, including zero-point unqualified quotes; it must not be
+read as a count of positive bonuses. The handoff records a separate paired
+ten-hour point probe. Per-room upkeep is an accrual allocation; total posted
+expense/cents remain authoritative, so rounding is not a second saving.
